  "body_html": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>name: Passarola #2 - Music variations on the past and the future - k.87</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><br>date: 2023-10-25<br>type: live act, music<br>event: CEM presentation<br>location: Biblioteca do Palácio Nacional de Mafra</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Concerto do projecto VIA Scarlatti | Passarola: Sonata em Si Menor, K.87, Domenico Scarlatti + Vítor Joaquim, Pedro Emanuel Pereira e Rui Gato, no contexto da apresentação do CEM Portugal, no Palácio Nacional de Mafra, sala da Biblioteca.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":2983,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/media/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Screenshot-2025-04-07-143121-1024x738.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2983\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":2984,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/media/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Screenshot-2025-04-07-143149-1024x715.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2984\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3247,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"/media/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/image.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3247\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3248,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"/media/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/image-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3248\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3249,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"is-style-default\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-style-default\"><img src=\"/media/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/image-2.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3249\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->"